---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About | Alan Nunes"
  description="Professional journey, engineering specialization, and core principles of Alan Nunes, Senior Software Engineer."
  lang="en"
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 sm:py-20">
    <Header currentPath="/en/about" lang="en" />

    <main class="py-12 sm:py-16">
      <div class="space-y-4 mb-12">
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-[var(--text-primary)]">About Me</h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-[var(--text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">
          Trajectory, technical focus, and engineering principles guiding my work.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Biographical Content with Clean Typography -->
      <div class="space-y-6 text-base sm:text-lg text-[var(--text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          Born in São Paulo, Brazil. Focused and observant, yet always open to a meaningful technical discussion and great
          conversations. Outside the terminal, I am driven by sports and gaming — pursuits that taught me firsthand the
          importance of discipline, making sound decisions under pressure, staying relentlessly curious, and continuous
          learning — core pillars that directly shape how I build software.
        </p>

        <p>
          My professional journey started early, at age 16, in corporate Logistics. Working as a young apprentice, I
          experienced high-paced operational environments, developing accountability and maturity well before writing my
          first line of commercial code.
        </p>

        <p>
          In 2014, while pursuing a degree in <em class="text-[var(--text-primary)]">Information Systems</em>, I began my
          technical path in IT support. Those years were essential for understanding real-world user pain points and system
          resilience, but my North Star was always software engineering. The transition demanded resilience — overcoming
          steep learning curves and betting entirely on continuous intensive training to create my own breakthrough.
        </p>

        <p>
          That persistence opened doors. In consulting (Opah IT), I engineered solutions for major enterprise clients such as <strong
            class="text-[var(--text-primary)]">Gerdau, SENAC, and CVC</strong
          >. Later, I tackled the high concurrency and massive scale of Brazilian e-commerce at <strong
            class="text-[var(--text-primary)]">B2W Digital</strong
          > (Americanas, Submarino, and Shoptime), working across critical post-purchase systems. I further honed my senior leadership
          at <strong class="text-[var(--text-primary)]">Luizalabs</strong>, contributing to one of the most innovative
          technology ecosystems in Latin America.
        </p>

        <p>
          Currently, I am a <strong class="text-[var(--text-primary)]">Senior Software Engineer</strong> at{' '}
          <a
            href="https://www.mercadolivre.com.br"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="text-[var(--color-brand-primary)] font-semibold hover:underline"
          >
            Mercado Libre
          </a>
          . My primary specialization is in <strong class="text-[var(--text-primary)]">Front-End</strong> and modern web architecture,
          combining technical precision, performance, and refined user experience. In continuous evolution, I am actively specializing
          in <strong class="text-[var(--color-brand-accent)]">Artificial Intelligence</strong>, alongside solid experience
          and practical knowledge building solutions in <strong class="text-[var(--text-primary)]">Back-End</strong> ecosystems.
        </p>

        <p>
          I keep my craft constantly sharpening: I hold postgraduate specializations in <strong
            class="text-[var(--text-primary)]">Software Engineering</strong
          > and in <strong class="text-[var(--text-primary)]">Applied Artificial Intelligence</strong>. I believe great
          engineering unites technical rigor, clarity, and human impact — building technologies that elevate the everyday
          lives of millions.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Social & Connect Links -->
      <div class="mt-14 pt-8 border-t border-[var(--border-subtle)] space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)]">Connect with me</h2>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 text-sm font-medium">
          <a
            href="https://github.com/alanunesouza"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg border border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--bg-surface)] text-[var(--text-secondary)] hover:text-[var(--text-primary)] hover:border-[var(--color-brand-primary)] transition-colors"
          >
            GitHub →
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/alanunesouza"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg border border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--bg-surface)] text-[var(--text-secondary)] hover:text-[var(--text-primary)] hover:border-[var(--color-brand-primary)] transition-colors"
          >
            LinkedIn →
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://twitter.com/alanhnunes"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg border border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--bg-surface)] text-[var(--text-secondary)] hover:text-[var(--text-primary)] hover:border-[var(--color-brand-accent)] transition-colors"
          >
            Twitter / X →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer
      class="pt-12 mt-12 border-t border-[var(--border-subtle)] flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-[var(--text-muted)]"
    >
      <div>
        © {new Date().getFullYear()} alannunes.com • All rights reserved.
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <a href="/policies" class="hover:text-[var(--text-primary)] transition-colors">Privacy</a>
        <span>•</span>
        <a
          href="https://github.com/alanunesouza/alannunes.com/blob/master/LICENSE"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="hover:text-[var(--text-primary)] transition-colors">Terms</a
        >
      </div>
    </footer>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
